Changes:
 edulution-linbo-vdi (1.1.1) noble; urgency=medium
 .
   * Accept start.conf.<group>.vdi files written by the edulution-ui group
     editor: group, format, scsihw, disk_bus and the pool sizes get defaults,
     size may be "80" or "80G".
   * vdi-setup asks for the OS first and defaults the group name to win10,
     win11 or ubuntu, the names the edulution Desktop app shows as cards.
